<title>POLAND: Poland to set min sugar price at 1.5 zlotys/kg.</title>
<headline>Poland to set min sugar price at 1.5 zlotys/kg.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish government's economic committee recommended to the full cabinet setting a minimum sugar wholesale price for the 1997/98 season at 1.5 zlotys per kg, the government's press office said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;The minimum sale price of sugar on the domestic market which would apply from October 1, 1997 to September 30, 1998 should be 1.5 zlotys per kg,&quot; it said in a statement.</p>
<p>The minimum price for the 1996/97 season was set at 1.33 zlotys.</p>
<p>The recommendation of the committee, which groups holders of economic portfolios, has yet to be approved by the full cabinet.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
